# Plan-file inspection depending on TensorRT's non-public layout; must not be published
tensorrt_cookbook/utils_private.py
# Its output is a field-by-field dump of that layout. `log-main.py.log` is pinned to the public view
# by the test config and is safe to commit; this one is not.
07-Tool/EnginePrinter/log-main.py-internal.log

# Offline install caches, deliberately not tracked. They are a *local* accelerator, not something
# the repository ships: a fresh clone still downloads everything once, and only the second and later
# setups on that machine are offline. Tracking them would put ~455 MB of wheels into git history
# permanently, and would not help anyway - `/work` already survives the container resets that wipe
# the installed packages. See dependence_packages/README.md.
dependence_packages/*.json
dependence_packages/apt/*.deb
dependence_packages/pip/*.whl
dependence_packages/resolved.txt
